          <text id="/data/results_group/res_impetigo:label">
            <value>Impetigo or Folliculitis</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/results_group/res_impetigo_action:label">
            <value>The youth may have impetigo or folliculitis. Clean sores with antiseptic. Drain pus if fluctuant. Start cloxacillin tablets if &gt;4cm or red streaks or tender nodes or multiple abscesses for 5 days (Apply antibiotic cream – triple antibiotic ointment).</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/results_group/res_ring_worm:label">
            <value>Ring Worm (Tinea)</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/results_group/res_ring_worm_action:label">
            <value>The youth may have ring worm. If limited to a few patches: Grisefulvine or Ketoconazole cream. If extensive give: griseofulvin tablets, 125 mg with fatty meal (10mg/kg/day), 2 tablets once a day for 6 weeks. If in hair: shave hair, treat as above. If infected (red, warm, pus) add cloxacilline.</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/results_group/res_scabies:label">
            <value>Scabies</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/results_group/res_scabies_action:label">
            <value>The youth may have scabies. Treat itching: Calamine lotion. Apply: 25% topical Benzyl Benzoate at night, repeat for 3 days after washing. Council hygiene measures: treat all people in the household who are affected, wash bed linen and clothes with warm water and put in the sun, wash affected persons. When infected add cloxaciline.</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/results_group/res_anemia:label">
            <value>Moderate Anemia</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/results_group/res_anemia_action:label">
            <value>The youth may have moderate anemia. Iron, folic acid – 1 tablet once a day, give for 14 days. Albendazole (400 mg) 1 tablet. Nutrition counseling: green leaves (panzou, lyann panye, moringa, boujon pwa, boujon manyok), fruits, rasped carots and red beet.</value>
          </text>
